[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2919075559","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106929#issuecomment-2919075559","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106929","id":2919075559,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t_Y7n","user":{"login":"comminux","id":14937307,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTM3MzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14937307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux","html_url":"https://github.com/comminux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T11:10:05Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T11:20:05Z","body":"I apologize, after creating this issue I decided to recheck the internal class **SubViewport** and then I managed to bypass the warning. I hope this solution will help someone else :)\n\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    var vp: SubViewport = get_viewport()\n    var screen_point: Vector2i = vp.size / 2\n    print(screen_point)\n```\n\nIf you call `get_viewport()` from a parent node that is **PanelContainer**, then `get_viewport()` will return **Window**, not **SubViewport**.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2919075559/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]